# UnsignedInteger8 addition at the type boundary

Verifies uint8 addition reaching exactly the 8-bit maximum through the
complete CLI pipeline. Every operand is uint8: the type has no mixed-type
operations.

>>> source
const left: uint8 = 200
const right: uint8 = 55

const boundary_sum: uint8 = left + right
print(boundary_sum)

<<< stdout
255

<<< stderr
